p class="text__desc" data-v-03e10e28>Evri reviews as GREAT at 4.1 out of 5 on Trustpilot, with over 4 million 5-star ratings. Whether you’re sending a single package, multiple orders, or making a return, our courier services cater and scale to your every need. We even deliver for most of the UK’s top brands, including eBay, Amazon, John Lewis, Next and ASOS.

