e cover, and delivery options as standard for you to stay up to speed and choose the best way for your recipient to receive their parcel. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="doyouhaveanyhiddencosts-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-doyouhaveanyhiddencosts" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-doyouhaveanyhiddencosts" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Do you have any hidden costs?-open answer" data-test-id="doyouhaveanyhiddencosts-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="doyouhaveanyhiddencosts-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Do you have any hidden costs?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-doyouhaveanyhiddencosts" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-doyouhaveanyhiddencosts" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="doyouhaveanyhiddencosts-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we like to keep prices transparent and as low as possible. Our postage prices vary depending on your location, destination, parcel weight, delivery method, speed of delivery, and the level of cover you choose. Check out our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><a href="/our-services/our-prices" rel="noreferrer" target="_blank"><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->full price list<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></a><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> to see how cheap it is to send with us.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isevriareliabledeliveryservice-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isevriareliabledeliveryservice" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isevriareliabledeliveryservice" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is Evri a reliable delivery service?-open answer" data-test-id="isevriareliabledeliveryservice-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isevriareliabledeliveryservice-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is Evri a reliable delivery service?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-isevriareliabledeliveryservice" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-isevriareliabledeliveryservice" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="isevriareliabledeliveryservice-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we strive to understand our customers, go the extra mile and care for every parcel. Evri reviews as great at 4.1 out of 5 on Trustpilot, with over 4 million 5-star ratings. We are trusted by some of the UK&#39;s biggest brands such as John Lewis, Next and Hello Fresh. Be assured that if you choose Evri for your parcels, we will do all we can to deliver your parcels safely and efficiently.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="isevrienvironmentallyfriendly-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-isevrienvironmentallyfriendly" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-isevrienvironmentallyfriendly" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Is Evri environmentally friendly?-open answer" data-test-id="isevrienvironmentallyfriendly-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="isevrienvironmentallyfriendly-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Is Evri environmentally friendly?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6